{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00749","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享文敬太子庙乐章 登歌 · 陈京","name":"郊庙歌辞 享文敬太子庙乐章 登歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"歌以德发，声以乐贵。\n乐善名存，追仙礼异。\n鸾旌拱修，凤鸣合吹。\n神听皇慈，仲月皆至。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈京","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00749.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00749","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}